Phase 2 (FullSpectrum engine emission, P2F): wire the FS
`enable_infill_filament_override` toggle + boundary-layer infill
base-reversion at the PrintRegion level.

Ported from FS v0.9.9 (`ratdoux/OrcaSlicer-FullSpectrum@v0.9.9` commit
b3c41fda), `src/libslic3r/PrintRegion.cpp` +32 LoC and
`src/libslic3r/Preset.cpp` +3 LoC.

Why this matters:

Before FS, `sparse_infill_filament` acted as an "implicit override"
when its value differed from `wall_filament` — sparse infill silently
used a different filament from walls if the user had ever set the
two to different values, even when they didn't actually want infill
to override.

FS v0.9.9 makes the override EXPLICIT via the
`enable_infill_filament_override` PrintRegionConfig key (declared in
patch 0027): when off (default), `frInfill` and same-filament
`frSolidInfill` both resolve to `wall_filament` even if the user
authored a different `sparse_infill_filament`. The boundary-layer
toggles (`infill_filament_use_base_first_layers` /
`_last_layers`) further force infill BACK to `wall_filament` on the
first or last N layers regardless of the override setting — useful
for clean top/bottom surfaces when the override-filament is darker
or shows through.

Changes:

1. `PrintRegion.cpp` — two anonymous-namespace helpers
   (`effective_sparse_infill_filament`,
   `internal_solid_infill_uses_sparse_filament`) plus updates to
   `PrintRegion::extruder(role)` (frInfill / frSolidInfill split),
   `nozzle_dmr_avg`, and the static
   `collect_object_printing_extruders(PrintConfig, PrintRegionConfig,
   has_brim, out)` overload to emit the wall extruder as an extra
   object extruder when boundary-layer reversion is configured.

2. `Preset.cpp` — adds the three FS region-level keys to
   `s_Preset_print_options` so process presets persist them and the
   dirty-check sees them as part of the print preset.

This is the PrintRegion-level peer to patch 0032 (which handles the
LayerRegion-level resolution and consults `MixedFilamentManager` for
virtual mixed-filament rows). PrintRegion is consulted at preset /
extruder-collection time (no Layer context yet, no virtual filament
resolution); LayerRegion at flow / make_perimeters time (full Layer
context, MixedFilamentManager-aware).

Verified compile-clean via incremental libslic3r rebuild (0 FAILED)
+ ./gradlew :app:assembleDebug (full APK assembled).

Hard dependencies:
  - patch 0027 (PrintRegionConfig fields enable_infill_filament_override
    + use_base_first_layers / _last_layers declared as typed members)

